      en: ["The main building of Skansen was completed in 1789.", "It is the oldest preserved house in the city of Tromsø.", "The fortress ramparts likely date back to around 1250.", "Skansen was designated a protected monument in 1978.", "The museum is part of the Perspektivet Museum network.", "A former 19th-century customs office is located within the complex."],
      es: ["Fundación: 1900", "Fundador: Hans Aall", "Número de edificios: más de 150", "Visitantes anuales: aprox. 200.000", "Ubicación: Península de Bygdøy", "Edificio más antiguo: Iglesia de madera de Gol (hacia 1200)"],
      pt: ["Fundação: 1900", "Fundador: Hans Aall", "Número de edifícios: mais de 150", "Visitantes anuais: aprox. 200.000", "Localização: Península de Bygdøy", "Edifício mais antigo: Igreja de madeira de Gol (cerca de 1200)"],
