      en: ["The National Gallery was officially founded in the year 1837.", "Edvard Munch's 'The Scream' (1893 version) was displayed here.", "The historic building was designed by Heinrich Ernst Schirmer.", "In 1994, 'The Scream' was stolen from the gallery and later recovered.", "The collection includes over 4,500 paintings and numerous sculptures.", "The new National Museum opened on June 11, 2022."],
      es: ["Fundación: 1837", "Colección: más de 4.500 obras", "Obra famosa: El Grito (1893)", "Inauguración del edificio: 1882", "Visitantes anuales: aprox. 500.000", "Entrada: gratuita desde 2014"],
      pt: ["Fundação: 1837", "Tamanho da coleção: mais de 4.500 obras", "Obra famosa: O Grito (1893)", "Abertura do edifício: 1882", "Visitantes anuais: aprox. 500.000", "Entrada: gratuita desde 2014"],
