      en: ["St. Mary's Church was built between 1130 and 1180.", "It is the oldest existing building in the city of Bergen.", "From 1408 to 1766, it served as the church for German Hanseatic merchants.", "The Baroque pulpit was a gift from the Hanseatic league in 1676.", "The church features a significant late Gothic winged altar.", "The church was closed for renovation between 2010 and 2015."],
