      en: ["The 1947 Kon-Tiki expedition covered 6,980 kilometers in 101 days.", "The museum was officially opened to the public on May 15, 1949.", "The reed boat Ra II crossed the Atlantic in 57 days in 1970.", "The documentary about the voyage won an Academy Award in 1951.", "The museum's library houses over 8,000 volumes from Heyerdahl's collection.", "A 10-meter model of a whale shark is displayed in the underwater section."],
      es: ["Inauguración: 1950", "Barcos expuestos: Kon-Tiki, Ra I, Ra II, Tigris", "Distancia navegada Kon-Tiki: 4.300 millas náuticas", "Duración del viaje Kon-Tiki: 101 días", "Visitantes anuales: aprox. 150.000", "Renovación: 2017"],
