      en: ["The museum was founded in 1905 and moved to Frogner Manor in 1909.", "Frogner Manor was originally the largest farm in the Oslo region.", "The photographic archive contains more than 1,000,000 historical images.", "The art collection features approximately 1,000 paintings and 6,000 prints.", "It became part of the 'Oslo Museum' foundation in 2006.", "The main manor building features architectural styles from the 1750s and 1790s."],
