      en: ["The museum was founded in 1914 and moved to Kjelsås in 1986.", "The total exhibition space covers approximately 12,000 square meters.", "The institution houses more than 25 distinct permanent exhibitions.", "The National Medical Museum became part of the facility in 2003.", "There are over 100 interactive stations in the Science Center section.", "The collection features Norway's first steam locomotive and historic aircraft."],
      es: ["Fundación: 1914", "Traslado: 1993", "Colección: más de 100.000 objetos", "Visitantes anuales: aprox. 250.000", "Superficie de exposición: 15.000 m²", "Ubicación: Kjelsås, Oslo"],
